## Date-8/2/2026

- Discussion:
-- We decide that we won't be following the exact way for SB and J type instructions where the immediate value is of 13 and 21 bits respectively in RISC-V which is very confusing where they are ignoring the end 0, and considering values from 12-1 so instead we made our immediate of 12 and 20 bits respectively and we are considering all the bits from 11 to 0 of the offset value 


